    81	cmp program-source.kore program-macro.kore
    82	```
    83	
    84	Actual result: both files are 4,214 bytes and `cmp` exited 0.
    85	
    86	## Proof-extension inventory
    87	
    88	### Exact AST macros
    89	
    90	- Extension: `filterLoopBody`, `filterFunctionBody`, and
    91	  `filterByPrefixProgram` in `verification-core.k`.
    92	- Class: definitional syntax aliases.
